  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "it should be possible to change the keyboard controls on pc. with a vr headset you can set each action to a certain key, but on keyboard if you log in via steam you can't change the keys and only view them in the options. therefore it should be possible to edit the keyboard bindings to your liking. i don't like to use \"c\" for crouching for example. so i would like to be able to change it to ctrl. furthermore it should be possible to turn fullscreen on/off and adjust the resolution. i'm still using a command in my steam vrchat properties in order to have fullscreen and full hd guaranteed. this should definitely be an option in the game itself just like changing the keyboard controls.",
